x.c('replay_projection',0,18,28,'Deterministic committed runtime projection','Same admitted events and declared inputs yield same projection. Live owner maintains incremental projection; cold acquisition/recovery reconstruct equivalent committed state. Replay-derived is source relation, not whole-history folding on every read/handoff; fluent writes cannot become rival authority. Explicit run/call/frame/continuation projections cannot hide subordinate aggregates inside run state.')
x.q('projection_completeness_and_aids',0,24,28,'replay_projection','If admitted state, including unknown/unresolved dispositions, cannot be determined from history/declared sources, model is constitutionally incomplete. Historical observation reconstruction does not establish present physical workspace state. Snapshots/checkpoints/summaries aid but never override replay.')
x.c('supervision_and_retry_projection',0,30,36,'Supervision and full retry frontier','Process-boundary replay exposes available process id,stream refs,latest heartbeat/liveness,timeout,signals,exit status/signal,error,final actor result. Retry frontier includes every prior attempt id,reason,owner,source event kind and coverage, not latest-only dossier.')
x.q('supervision_evidence_and_fullness',0,30,36,'supervision_and_retry_projection','Liveness/timeouts/streams derive admitted events, never transcript parsing,polling side effects or Product controller state. Structural full-projection assertions validate row shape,deterministic ids,reason and attempt coverage; closure-critical consumers should prefer replay-derived projections or compare supplied ones to replay.',conditions=['Process dispatch or supplied retry-frontier projection is used.'])
x.q('admitted_action_and_temporal_projection',0,38,46,'replay_projection','Nonprogress summaries/CLI/consumers render same admitted continuation and NextActionProjection; candidate evaluateNext becomes truth only after ABG admission, never projector decision. Modulation deterministically folds qualifier,basis,schedules,progress,backend classification,review and nonprogress/foldback/reentry. HoldsAt derives events,declared effects,initial truth,clipping,derived rules, not rival transitions. Temporal projection uses admitted timers/deadlines/continuations; may feed gap/selection pressure, never eligibility/advance/closure or override aggregates. Schedule/SLA/drift homeostasis stays separate from traversal completeness.')
x.c('runtime_liveness_projection',0,48,50,'Single runtime liveness projection','Fold admitted probes,actor lifecycle,runtime asset/artifact/structured observations,inactivity policy,interruptions,retry budgets; activity can include logs,ledgers,manifests,reports/dossiers,archive/sidecar,PTY/stream updates. Expose probe coverage,active/inactive/interrupted systems,last activity/artifact,lease,safety cap and one disposition: wait,controlled termination,retry,yield,block,inspect archive,escalate,policy reprice.')
x.q('liveness_overlay_and_transition_priority',0,48,54,'runtime_liveness_projection replay_projection','Summaries/watchdogs/consumers read liveness disposition, never recompute from local process/files/transcript/timers. Overlay derives declaration/evaluation events and admitted observations; reject unsupported satisfied/missing-ref predicate states. Completion clears pressure only with admitted declared clearing evidence or declared no-close preservation. Active-boundary transition projection is single when continuation/retry/liveness/assurance/fallback affect action; admitted runtime/assurance outranks terminal retry refs. Retry refs only select absent higher typed fact; unknown/unsupported mixed states fail closed with provenance, not fresh dispatch.')
x.q('scope_and_executive_projection',0,56,64,'replay_projection','Evaluation scopes are admitted/replay facts bound to call/frame/function/vector/index/composition/topology, never prompt/diagnostic/file/controller invention. Executive observation derives environment/workspace,event,payload,evidence,requirement,residual,continuation,span-lineage refs as input to gap/executive evaluator; it cannot emit events,write ledgers,mutate graph/workspace or create parallel ontology.')
x.q('one_surface_pure_reads_and_observation',0,66,70,'replay_projection','Project admitted model,snapshot,gap,target-binding,priority,fulfillment,closure,next-action with exact program/workspace/basis/lineage/causal/source refs; no missing-carrier synthesis or semantic-owner transfer. 5.0 project.read purely renders catalog/status/result/evidence/replay/gaps/lawful actions from owners, no evaluation/eligibility/ranking/selection/admission/invocation/continuation/events/closure. Observer-report/drafts/tuning reports and draft exclusions are planned 5.1. New same-binding/basis observation may invalidate/recompute dependent model/gap/target/priority/selection, never rebind/fork; authority changes follow binding/continuation law.')
x.q('reuse_equivalence_and_uncertain_effects',0,72,84,'replay_projection','Reuse established facts only under exact subject,basis,scope,provenance,validity. Internal role/function boundary alone triggers neither whole-history rebuild nor reauthentication; whole-history dependency names governing relation/extent. Qualification compares live/cold at same committed boundary and retains checks at real acquisition/invalidation/authority/effect boundaries. If effects may have occurred but required successor observation unavailable, withdraw dependent currentness over potentially affected scope, retain unaffected facts and original failure; unknown physical state is not unchanged,rollback or fabricated observation.')
