x.q('proof_carry_domain_scope',6,29,40,'paired_requirement_proof','Carry-through applies across admitted terms/relations,edge requirement environments,instructions,function denotation,frames/continuations,payload/evidence,assurance,residual,foldback,convergence. It is language-agnostic: software source/tests are one binding; models/process/procedures/simulations/human packets/verifier runs/semantic interpretation may realize other domains. Each applicable obligation needs paired realization and proof witnesses before closure.')
